      "id": 1,
      "text": "Austin, Mississippi, was founded in 1847 and named after landowner Austin Miller, who donated the plot for the town and courthouse.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
